flowchart TD
    F[Uploaded file / text version] --> V[DocumentVersion]
    V --> E[E Extraction]
    E --> ET[extracted_text]
    ET --> N[N Normalization]
    N --> NT[normalized_text + content_hash]
    NT --> S[S Structural segmentation]
    S --> CKS[Chunk rows]

    CKS --> C[C Comparison]
    C --> CMP[VersionComparison]
    CMP --> CHI[VersionChangeItem diff rows]
    CHI --> P[P Prioritization / significance]
    P --> SIG[semantic_type, label, score, reason, rules, manual_review]

    SIG --> G1[G Summary generation]
    G1 --> SUM[Summary.text + highlights]
    SUM --> G2[G Quiz generation]
    G2 --> QZ[GeneratedQuiz draft + Question + Choice]

    QZ --> H[Human approval workflow]
    H --> PEND[pending_review]
    PEND --> APP[approved]
    PEND --> REJ[rejected]
    QZ --> SUP[superseded when newer quiz is generated]

    APP --> R[R Result fixation]
    R --> ATT[QuizAttempt in_progress]
    ATT --> SUB[Submit answers]
    SUB --> ANS[Answer rows]
    SUB --> RES[score, correct_answers, score_percent, completed_at]
    RES --> REP[Result/reporting payload]

    REP -. optional .-> LLM[LLM feedback enhancement]
    LLM -. fallback .-> REP
